{"id":"661727","name":"肉丝蒜苔","author":"双鱼座的美食","authorId":"11350065","desc":"","cover":"images/661727/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"蒜苔","amount":"一小把"}],"sub":[{"name":"里脊肉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"木耳","amount":"五六朵"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"洗干净。","img":"images/661727/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"木耳焯水三五分钟。","img":"images/661727/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"菜和肉切丝摆盘，里脊肉用了1/3。","img":"images/661727/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"葱姜爆香，放入肉丝翻炒变色，倒点酱油上色。","img":"images/661727/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"盛出备用。","img":"images/661727/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"另起锅，葱姜蒜爆香，放入蒜苔翻炒到变色。","img":"images/661727/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加点盐，倒入木耳，炒好的肉丝。","img":"images/661727/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"翻炒一下，淋上香油。","img":"images/661727/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"上桌。","img":"images/661727/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}